@startuml CodeUnits-Overview
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
title CodeUnits of GenericMCPServer

[GenericMCPServerBackend]
note as GenericMCPServerBackendNote
  GenericMCPServerBackend is a generic MCP-Server.
end note
GenericMCPServerBackend .. GenericMCPServerBackendNote

[GenericMCPServer]
note as GenericMCPServerNote
  GenericMCPServer is the container-image which packages the backend which hosts the declared MCP-servers.
end note
GenericMCPServer .. GenericMCPServerNote

GenericMCPServer --> GenericMCPServerBackend

@enduml